        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Count a List\n\nCounts the items passing through a stream. The counter works on the stream, so it behaves the same whatever produced the items. It runs in-process with no model, key or cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Source list\" holds six colour names. \"Fan out\" emits them one at a time. \"2 Count\" counts the stream, and \"3 Result\" shows the total.\n\n**Try this:** Add or remove entries in \"1 Source list\" and check that \"3 Result\" changes to match."
        },
